  "body": "`crates/ui/tests/theme_files.rs::the_shipped_example_parses` is red on `main` (575f02d8):\n\n```\nassert_eq!(theme.tokens.cell_h, 35.0);   // left 40.0, right 35.0\n```\n\nPR #767 (merged 2026-11-11, commit 33cd8b56 \"polish ribbon, viewport empty state and ground grid\") raised `cell_h` from 35.0 to 40.0 in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/theme.rs` (both the dark and light columns, lines 145/187). The theme-file test still pins the dark column's old 35.0 for an untouched field, so every ui `theme_files` run now fails. Found while re-gating #564 after a merge of main; #564 touches no theme code.\n\nDone means: `the_shipped_example_parses` asserts the current dark-column `cell_h` (40.0, or read it from the dark tokens so a later restyle doesn't break it again), and the ui `theme_files` suite is green on main.\n",
